	quest.C30000000000009C.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Increases the SP regen rate of Auto Recovery skills by +0.5/s", "Description: Supposedly the Banshees make their aromatics only for their beloved. A single drop is enough to enchant just about anyone, bringing out any artist's inspiration and creativity.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
