	quest.C30000000000009E.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Increases the SP regen rate of Offensive and Defensive Recovery skills by 1 SP per 3s.", "Description: A wine produced in the Iberian region. Despite having gained popularity in the heart of Victoria's bustling cities, it is now discontinued.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C40000000000009E.title: "Obtain Captain Morgans Wine"
	quest.C30000000000009F.title: "Water Of Life"
	quest.C30000000000009F.quest_subtitle: "No.159 · Offense"
	quest.C30000000000009F.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Increases the SP regen rate of Offensive and Defensive Recovery skills by 1 SP per 2.5s.", "Description: The strongest Ursine liquors go straight to one's head, but it's said that the healthy Ursine adult can down several bottles.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C40000000000009F.title: "Obtain Water Of Life"
	quest.C3000000000000A0.title: "Royal Liqueur"
	quest.C3000000000000A0.quest_subtitle: "No.160 · Offense"
	quest.C3000000000000A0.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Increases the SP regen rate of Offensive and Defensive Recovery skills by 1 SP per 1.5s.", "Description: The fine wines of the extinct country, Gaul, have now become expensive, prime treasures for collectors. The place of production is now a part of Leithanien, but the technique has been lost.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C4000000000000A0.title: "Obtain Royal Liqueur"
	quest.C3000000000000A5.title: "Coin Operated Toy"
	quest.C3000000000000A5.quest_subtitle: "No.165 · Offense"
	quest.C3000000000000A5.quest_desc: ["Original effect: For each 5 Originium Ingots in possession, all friendly units have +3 ASPD", "Description: No idea why anyone would like a design like this, but its overall concept is indeed praiseworthy—Just insert a coin, and even a statue will start moving. There is nothing truer in this world.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C4000000000000A5.title: "Obtain Coin Operated Toy"
	quest.C3000000000000A6.title: "Chivalric Commandments New Edition"
	quest.C3000000000000A6.quest_subtitle: "No.166 · Offense"
	quest.C3000000000000A6.quest_desc: ["Original effect: For each 5 Originium Ingots in possession, all friendly units have +5 ASPD", "Description: Taking solemn vows is a thing of the past. The spirit of modern knighthood requires more flexible displays. Go ahead and input your number in the communications device, and you too will be an honorary knight.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
