	quest.C3000000000000AA.title: "Wrath Of Siracusans"
	quest.C3000000000000AA.quest_subtitle: "No.170 · Offense"
	quest.C3000000000000AA.quest_desc: ["Original effect: All friendly units have +100% ATK for one second after their skill becomes active", "Description: The signature pasta dish of an 'authentic Siracusan restaurant' that once operated in the capital of Gaul. The dish's unique taste, and particularly its sauce, a blend of thick chocolate sauce and Originium Slug liver, earned the praise of many Gaulish nobles. Supposedly, though, this dish nearly caused a diplomatic crisis between Siracusa and Gaul.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C4000000000000AA.title: "Obtain Wrath Of Siracusans"
	quest.C3000000000000AC.title: "Ribbon Of Honor"
	quest.C3000000000000AC.quest_subtitle: "No.172 · Offense"
	quest.C3000000000000AC.quest_desc: ["Original effect: All friendly units have +100% ATK when blocking only one enemy", "Description: Numerous actors have played this character, yet none of them were able to save the character's dearest friend.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C4000000000000AC.title: "Obtain Ribbon Of Honor"
	quest.C3000000000000C1.title: "Right Eye Of The Natator"
	quest.C3000000000000C1.quest_subtitle: "No.193 · Offense"
	quest.C3000000000000C1.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Guard and Sniper Operators have +15% ATK, but Supporter and Caster Operators have -5% ATK", "Description: One half of the Gaulish empress's crown is now housed in the Royal Museum of Londinium. When she learned of the death of the emperor, the empress consort was determined to fight her enemies to the end—for her country, and for her departed beloved.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C4000000000000C1.title: "Obtain Right Eye Of The Natator"
	quest.C3000000000000C2.title: "Left Eye Of The Natator"
	quest.C3000000000000C2.quest_subtitle: "No.194 · Offense"
	quest.C3000000000000C2.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Supporter and Caster Operators have +15% ATK, but Guard and Sniper Operators have -5% ATK", "Description: One half of the Gaulish empress's crown is now stored housed in the Leithanian Queen Library. The empress dismissed all her attendants, granted clemency to all criminals, and sat solemnly alone on the throne that was once her husband's, awaiting the invaders—She was determined to die not by at hands of her enemies, but under the effects of Originium crystals.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C4000000000000C2.title: "Obtain Left Eye Of The Natator"
