	quest.C3000000000000AE.quest_subtitle: "No.174 · Survival"
	quest.C3000000000000AE.quest_desc: ["Original effect: For one time only during any battle prior to the final battle of the area, gain 1 Life Point and continue onto the next step instead of concluding the exploration upon mission failure", "Description: As long as a new cycle has not been reached, there is still time to fix your mistakes.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
