	quest.C3000000000000B5.quest_subtitle: "No.181 · Survival"
	quest.C3000000000000B5.quest_desc: ["Original effect: All enemy units have +30% ATK, DEF, and Max HP; Entering a new node decreases Life Point by 1 (cannot be reduced beneath 1 this way)", "Description: It was not long ago that the Witch King's scepter flowed with daylight and the night sky.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
