	quest.C3000000000000CF.title: "Beauty And Ugliness In The Age Of Terra"
	quest.C3000000000000CF.quest_subtitle: "No.207 · Survival"
	quest.C3000000000000CF.quest_desc: ["Original effect: For one time only during any battle prior to the final battle of the area, gain 10 Life Points and continue onto the next step instead of concluding the exploration upon mission failure", "Description: A legendary book published in Victoria fifteen years ago. The book describes the author's appreciation of aesthetics in simple terms, and it contains a comprehensive record of literary, artistic and musical knowledge and history. The book covers both the past and present and is an easy read, with many honoring it as the 'great art encyclopedia of our generation.' Yet it is rumored that the book's author was the leader of a certain small troupe and was murdered a few years ago by a hitman codenamed 'Blood Diamond.'", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C4000000000000CF.title: "Obtain Beauty And Ugliness In The Age Of Terra"
	quest.C3000000000000DA.title: "Empresses Wish"
	quest.C3000000000000DA.quest_subtitle: "No.218 · Survival"
	quest.C3000000000000DA.quest_desc: ["Original effect: All allied units have +15% Physical and Arts Dodge", "Description: The Twin Empresses tower above. When dawn and dusk are one, there shall be no more dissent in Leithanien.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
