	quest.C3000000000000EF.quest_desc: ["Original effect: When Life Point is 1, all friendly units have +50 ASPD", "Description: Beautiful wishes made in dire straits can bring hope, even if they are not necessarily the truth.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
