	quest.C300000000000024.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Gain an additional choice when collectibles are dropped after battle", "Description: A symbol of luck that Magallan found in a place all but devoid of life. The rock has no doubt experienced many violent changes of the lands, but it survived, giving those who come across it a small bit of lingering hope.\n", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
