	quest.C3000000000000CB.quest_desc: ["Original effect: When the battle begins, randomize all allied operators' Deployment Cost", "Description: An artifact left behind by a 'Crimson Troupe' member. The stage name 'White Solanum' belonged to a famous Leithanian opera actress. Supposedly, the actress revered as the 'Whiteflower that stands atop the high tower' had complex relationships with many of the tower's nobles, and she even tried to spark a few scuffles among them.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
