	quest.7D01000000000001.quest_subtitle: "Summary of PRTS nation records"
	quest.7D01000000000001.quest_desc: ["A deep-sea nation that remains relatively closed to the outside world. Scientific and technical consuls hold state power, while forces including the Abyssal Hunters and maritime patrols oppose the Seaborn.\n\nSource boundary: PRTS Terra geography records; this entry does not invent undisclosed lore."]
