	chapter.7A00000000000008.title: "Laterano: National Dossier"
	quest.7D08000000000001.title: "National Setting"
	quest.7D08000000000001.quest_subtitle: "Summary of PRTS nation records"
	quest.7D08000000000001.quest_desc: ["A theocratic state in central Terra. Public authority is exercised in the name of the Law by the Pope and Curia, while long-standing neutrality and a central location make Laterano an important free-trade hub.\n\nSource boundary: PRTS Terra geography records; this entry does not invent undisclosed lore."]
