	quest.7D09000000000001.quest_subtitle: "Summary of PRTS nation records"
	quest.7D09000000000001.quest_desc: ["An elective monarchy and confederation whose nine electoral districts retain their own governments, laws, and armies. Originium Arts, music, and arts education profoundly shape its politics and society.\n\nSource boundary: PRTS Terra geography records; this entry does not invent undisclosed lore."]
