	chapter.7A00000000000013.title: "Iberia: National Dossier"
	quest.7D13000000000001.title: "National Setting"
	quest.7D13000000000001.quest_subtitle: "Summary of PRTS nation records"
	quest.7D13000000000001.quest_desc: ["A southern coastal nation that once became a great maritime power with Aegirian technology. It declined severely after the Profound Silence and is now governed by the Inquisition under an increasingly conservative isolation.\n\nSource boundary: PRTS Terra geography records; this entry does not invent undisclosed lore."]
